# 1.8.9 references and what they are on 1.21.11, for the legacy code; see
# tools/Retarget.java for the rule forms. Right-hand sides are in Yarn's
# names, which the build turns into intermediary ones with everything else
# written for 1.21. Members mostly go through the shims, which are plain code
# under cobble/v1_21/compat; only the classes are listed here.

